                "reply_count": 14,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "As I voted NO on the big ugly bill, I could not help but think about how the local nonprofits, parents, and experts I met with explained how they would be impacted by MAGA Republicans' cuts to Head Start, Medicaid, and SNAP. They are who we should be fighting for, not billionaires.",
