                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "What has been called Big and Beautiful is as Cruel and Ugly a piece of legislation as I have ever seen in my 19 years in Congress. This Big Ugly Bill cuts access to healthcare for 17 million Americans, which will lead to thousands of premature and preventable deaths all because big shots in government want to give their multimillionaire and billionaire donors another huge tax cut. All who vote \u201cYes\u201d on this cruel legislation that cuts food funding for those who need it most, will have American\u2019s blood on their hands.",
